<title>USA: Arthrocare names Baker president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Arthrocare names Baker president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>ArthroCare Corp said Wednesday it named Michael Baker president and chief executive officer.</p>
<p>He replaces Hira Thapliyal, who was named chief technology officer, and will continue to serve on the company's board of directors.</p>
<p>Baker joins ArthroCare from Medtronic Inc, where he was vice president and general manager in charge of the company's coronary angioplasty business unit.</p>
